      "parameters": {
        "width": 320,
        "height": 180,
        "content": "## Enrichment microservice\nSelf-hosted service at `enrich.internal`.\nFans out to Apollo / Clearbit / Prospeo,\n**caches by domain** (Redis TTL) and **batches**\nto control per-lookup cost. Single stable\ncontract for n8n; providers can be swapped\nwithout touching the workflow. See README."
      },
      "id": "c307b179-5161-40ad-80ab-1c2e54a2eb5b",
      "name": "Sticky: Enrichment microservice",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 300,
        "height": 160,
        "content": "## Idempotent dedup\nSearch CRM by normalized email BEFORE writing.\nExisting -> update path (keeps 1 contact),\nNew -> create path. Re-submits never create\nduplicate contacts."
      },
      "id": "ad0e029d-cefc-4512-bc3c-f7522bf736cb",
      "name": "Sticky: Idempotent dedup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -960,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 320,
        "height": 160,
        "content": "## Error observability\nError Trigger catches ANY node failure,\nlogs a structured payload to the ops store,\nand pings #ops on Slack. Set this workflow\nas the Error Workflow in n8n settings."
      },
      "id": "12b380f5-92b6-452e-84e6-8fdcd6a4e9b1",
      "name": "Sticky: Error observability",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
